The files in this directory (NAFNet_arch.py, arch_util.py, local_arch.py)
are vendored from https://github.com/megvii-research/NAFNet
(commit as of 2026-08-28), used under the following license, reproduced
in full as required by its terms. Minor modifications made for
standalone use outside the original basicsr framework: import paths
changed to relative imports, and an unused get_root_logger import
removed (see arch_util.py -- it was only referenced from dead,
commented-out code in the original).

Paper: Chen, Liangyu, et al. "Simple Baselines for Image Restoration."
ECCV 2022. arXiv:2204.04676.

